# SPA fallback for Cloudflare Pages and Netlify.
#
# This app keeps its screen in React state rather than in the URL, so every
# path has to return index.html. Without this, a refresh on anything other
# than "/" 404s against a file that was never built — the app looks broken
# to anyone who reloads or opens a bookmark.
#
# Vercel ignores this file; it does the same job through the "rewrites"
# block in vercel.json. Shipping both costs nothing and means moving hosts
# is a dashboard change rather than a code change — which matters, because
# Vercel's Hobby plan forbids commercial use and this app takes payments.
/*  /index.html  200
